# Pinned SHA-256 of the committed sherpa-onnx Android runtime.
#
# The artifact is the locally rebuilt v1.13.8 runtime carrying the
# CVE-2026-108954 / GHSA-f5q5-vp8g-wh4x joiner-width validation. Upstream
# v1.13.8, v2.0.1 and master still contain the unchecked width access, so the
# upstream AAR must never be substituted here.
#
# Single source of truth for:
#   - gradle/sherpa-aar-integrity.gradle (verifySherpaAar, run by release builds)
#   - android/kokoro-poc/scripts/fetch-sherpa-onnx.sh (CI provisioning)
#   - CI digest checks
#
# sha256sum(1) format; verify manually with:
#   cd artifacts/weather-app/android/daymark-voice/libs &&
#     shasum -a 256 -c ../sherpa-aar.sha256
#
# Provenance: daymark-voice/SHERPA-ONNX-PROVENANCE.md
